'''Thundia''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.1 Update|Version 2.1]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]], [[RED BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|RED BUSTERS]] or [[Best of the Best (Gacha Event)|Best of the Best]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases her attack power, health, range and speed. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] increases health, attack power, movement speed, standing range and attack frequency, decreases recharge time, and gains 100% Survive, Slow and Weaken Immunity, and Multi-hit Long Distance attacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

